SUMMARY:Zion — the week before Thanksgiving\, 2026
LOCATION:Springdale\, UT\, Zion National Park
GEO:37.1889;-112.9986
DESCRIPTION:Three nights in Springdale (plus a Las Vegas night on the way in) with Zion Canyon a mile up the road. Late November means cool\, quiet trails\, a shuttle that is still running\, and the last week before the holiday crowds. There is room for more people: here is where we’ll be\, when\, and what’s worth coming for.\\nhttps://aaronmsoto.github.io/travel-guides/guides/zion/
